 r←Test_Input_Misc_017(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;globalParms;parms;txt
⍝ Exercise "Input" with a menubar.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.InputDataTypes
 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 #.TEMP.GetMenu←{
     r←''
     r,←⊂'[&Edit] {edit}'
     r,←⊂' Copy input=Ctrl+C : ∆OnMenuInInput {copy}'
     r,←⊂' Paste my data=Ctrl+V : ∆OnMenuInInput {paste}'
     r,←⊂'[Misc] {misc}'
     r,←⊂' Special : {special} ; Blablabla'
     r,←⊂'; More : {more} ;'
     r}

 defMat←0 7⍴''
 defMat⍪←'Name' '' 'Johann Wolfgang von Goethe'DT.Character 0 1 1
 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.menubar←#.TEMP.GetMenu ⍬
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo
 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
 0 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp 7≠↑⍴n.menubar.∆List''
 →GoToTidyUp 6≠⍴n.menubar.∆GetRefs''

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
